OL,3,AHow landscape gardening is being
OL,4,Aelectrified
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the soundtrack to a day in
OL,7,Fsouthern California is the drone of
OL,8,Fpetrol-powered gardening equipment.
OL,10,FNoise is one of the main reasons that
OL,11,Fcities around the US, external are
OL,12,Fbanning petrol landscaping tools or
OL,13,Fencouraging electric alternatives.
OL,15,FThese alternatives have the additional
OL,16,Fbenefits of reducing carbon emissions,
OL,17,Fvibrations and the exposure of
OL,18,Flandscapers to pollution.
OL,20,FIn addition they can mean longer
OL,21,Fworking hours, as they can be used at
OL,22,Ftimes when residents demand quiet.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/18
