OL,3,AMeghan in talks for role in Netflix
OL,4,Aseries The Gentlemen, BBC understands
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Duchess of Sussex is in talks to
OL,7,Freturn to acting with a role in Netflix
OL,8,Fseries The Gentlemen, the BBC has
OL,9,Flearned.
OL,11,FDiscussions are in their early stages
OL,12,Fbut this would be Meghan's first
OL,13,Fsignificant acting role since her
OL,14,Fmarriage to Prince Harry.
OL,16,FMuch of the two previous series of The
OL,17,FGentlemen, which was created by Guy
OL,18,FRitchie, have been filmed in the
OL,19,FCotswolds - the area it is rumoured
OL,20,FHarry and Meghan will set up home when
OL,21,Fthey return to the UK later this month.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/18
