OL,3,APrince Harry and six others face
OL,4,Aprivacy case legal bill of up to #34.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FPrince Harry and six other public
OL,7,Ffigures face paying up to #34.5m to the
OL,8,Fpublisher of the Daily Mail after a
OL,9,FHigh Court judge imposed an exceptional
OL,10,Forder for legal costs over their failed
OL,11,Fprivacy case.
OL,13,FThe seven claimants, also including Sir
OL,14,FElton John and Liz Hurley, must pay an
OL,15,Finitial #9.54m by Friday of next week
OL,16,Fto Associated Newspapers Limited (ANL).
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
PN,11912
SC,0012
CT,25,T
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787428108
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,APrince Harry and six others face
OL,4,Aprivacy case legal bill of up to #34.5m
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe judge ruled that the case was a
OL,7,Frare one in which the claimants should
OL,8,Fhave to pay far in excess of the costs
OL,9,Fthat had been agreed before trial,
OL,10,Fcriticising how they presented their
OL,11,Fclaims as "unreasonable to a high
OL,12,Fdegree".
OL,14,FOn 7 July, Judge Mr Justice Nicklin
OL,15,Fdismissed the claims of unlawful
OL,16,Finformation-gathering, which ANL
OL,17,Fdenied.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/18
