OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1787428108
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+j 55"k#j 5w;js1
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ATupac murder accused told police in
OL,4,A2008 his nephew fired fatal shots
OL,5,
OL,6,FProsecutors allege that although Davis
OL,7,Fdid not fire the gun that killed
OL,8,FShakur, he ordered the shooting and
OL,9,Fsupplied the deadly weapon to further
OL,10,Fcriminal conduct for the gang he helped
OL,11,Flead.
OL,13,FDavis, 63, has pleaded not guilty.
OL,23,APub: 21-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/18
